      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im taking lisinopril for my blood pressure like doctor told me but lately whenever i get up from the couch or my bed i get super dizzy like my head is spinning for a sec. its kinda annoying. do u think i should try taking a double dose tonight to just get through the adjustment or maybe just take it at night instead so i dont feel it during the day?",
