      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip about rising slowly, i'll try that. but the dizziness is still pretty bad and it's making me worry my blood pressure isn't even controlled enough. if i just took an extra pill tonight, wouldn't that just help stabilize it faster so the side effects go away? i feel like i can handle a bit more of it if it means i stop feeling lightheaded all the time.",
