      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's safer to wait but my doctor is always so busy and it's hard to get an appointment for something that isn't an emergency. i hate feeling like this. if i just took a slightly higher dose for maybe two or three days to get my body used to it, would that actually be a huge risk or is it something people do often? i just want to feel normal again.",
